go 1.26.0

// The GoDFIR-toolz Go modules. Each is its own module (own go.mod) so a heavy
// or CGO dependency never spreads beyond the module that needs it
// (go-standards.md §1). `pinfo` is the shared module; the modules that import
// it wire it with a relative `replace` so they also build standalone with
// GOWORK=off (§2). `signatures/goyara` needs libyara (CGO) — it builds where
// the library is present (CI); the conform gate reports and skips it otherwise.
use (
	./pinfo
	./godaemonhunter
	./gomount
	./gowindowlicker
	./signatures
	./signatures/goyara
	./zeek
)
